#NEXUS

[ lockwood2021a_fig23: Iguanodontian strict consensus, panel A, 41 tips. Polytomies: Hadrosauriformes with eleven children (ten taxa plus Hadrosauroidea), Dryosauridae with three, and Equijubus + (Penelopognathus, Batyrosaurus) + the rest. Black dots mark named nodes and are not tips. Random-sample case (seed 20261106). Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node against the listed node lines; topology only. ]

